  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5301.02 Beginning rider",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5301.02 \"Beginning rider\" means a student who has:\n\n(a) Little or no previous motorcycle riding experience; and\n\n(b) Not obtained a valid motorcycle endorsement on their driver license.\n\nSource. #8403, eff 8-2-05; ss by #10589, eff 5-14-14; ss by #14174, eff 1-17-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5300.html"
